{"suttaId":"tha-ap519","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3315,3335],"vripara":"37"},"segments":{"tha-ap519:0.3":"Kuṭajapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap519:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, vasalo [cāvalo (sī. pī.), accayo (syā.)] nāma pabbato;","tha-ap519:1.3":"Buddho sudassano nāma, vasate pabbatantare.","tha-ap519:2.1":"“Pupphaṃ hemavantaṃ gayha, vehāsaṃ agamāsahaṃ;","tha-ap519:2.3":"Tatthaddasāsiṃ sambuddhaṃ, oghatiṇṇamanāsavaṃ.","tha-ap519:3.1":"“Pupphaṃ kuṭajamādāya, sire katvāna añjaliṃ [katvānahaṃ tadā (syā. pī. ka.)];","tha-ap519:3.3":"Buddhassa abhiropesiṃ, sayambhussa mahesino.","tha-ap519:4.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap519:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap519:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap519:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap519:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap519:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kuṭajapupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap519:9.1":"Kuṭajapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
